      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO NOTTHEBUTTONS (9) has had two months off since he was beaten as favourite last start but was kept up to the mark with a nice trial. Good effort to place from a wider barrier two back at Menangle. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line and if he gets the gaps could be tough to hold out. KANENA PROVLIMA (11) was solid when fifth last start at Menangle and placed there three back. Tricky draw but is suited returning to a circuit where he owns a good record and his best form would win this. RIVERA LOU (6) is having his first run back from a spell of 11 weeks. Boasts a record of three wins and a placing from four fresh attempts and strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance so expecting a bright start to the campaign. ALTA SIERRA (10) can do better in this more suitable race.",
